# Article 4 – Community License

The following users may use the Software free of charge:

* Registered NGOs
* Educational Institutions
* Students
* Academic Researchers
* Approved Contributors
* Individuals using the Software solely for personal learning

Such users may:

* Study the Software
* Modify the Software
* Deploy the Software solely for permitted purposes
* Contribute improvements back to the project

No Commercial Rights are granted under this Article.

